    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Aches and tiredness; temperature up to 37.6 °C at home</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Runny, blocked nose and sore throat; no ear pain</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild dry cough; no breathlessness or wheeze</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Positive</td><td>Feels his heart beating faster; no chest pain or fainting</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No headache, vision change or weakness</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
